WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.701
Unpivoting converts repeated measure columns into
rows The wide

00:00:05.727 --> 00:00:11.256
source has one product row with several month
columns The long result

00:00:11.282 --> 00:00:16.842
will have a month column and a revenue column The
row grain changes from one

00:00:16.869 --> 00:00:18.566
product to one product-month
